Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.40,0:00:06.50,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去寻找吧 收集起梦的碎片{\fad(250,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.51,0:00:17.58,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使胸中苦闷 去感受真切的现在吧{\fad(0,400)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.39,0:00:22.52,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比外表更单纯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.13,0:00:26.09,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是却无法传达
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.90,0:00:33.60,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要说的话 总是藏在口袋里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.17,0:00:40.11,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,充满孩子气的话语 如今已无法开口
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.54,0:00:48.07,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽说时间会冲淡一切 我们却无法相互理解
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.28,0:00:54.52,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,24小时 一直相信着你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.42,0:00:58.12,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.16,0:01:02.79,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使只是俗常的话语
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:09.16,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时间总是 微笑着匆匆流逝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.34,0:01:20.87,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比起回忆 还是去追求理想的今天{\fad(0,1025)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.22,0:01:58.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.76,0:02:04.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第52话 扼止不了的妖怪本性
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.11,0:02:20.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里有好多酒 头目
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.95,0:02:23.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过来这里倒酒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.79,0:02:35.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愈来愈衰弱了吧 半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.76,0:02:37.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自讨苦吃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.40,0:02:40.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和人类一个鼻孔出气 就是这种下场
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.63,0:02:42.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟了 结界…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.77,0:02:45.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,气力已经到极限了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.17,0:02:48.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.18,0:02:53.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也快点去陪我们头目
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.45,0:03:01.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害怕吗 女人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.02,0:03:03.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好 这表情很好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.34,0:03:21.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他果然是个妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.81,0:03:25.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每次陪头目的女人都会不见
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.84,0:03:27.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我正觉得奇怪的说
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.38,0:03:30.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这卑劣的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.45,0:03:34.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吧 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.35,0:03:36.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,振作一点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.12,0:03:39.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毒已经扩散到全身了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.36,0:03:45.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,半妖 临死前就在那里欣赏
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.20,0:03:49.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她们一个个被吃掉的画面吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.65,0:04:04.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要有那把刀就能救大家了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.86,0:04:10.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老头
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.29,0:04:12.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.19,0:04:16.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托你 用这把刀救救她们
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.90,0:04:19.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这臭老头
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.60,0:04:23.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？你还没睡醒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.40,0:04:27.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们通通完蛋啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.18,0:04:33.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.05,0:04:37.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 竟然敢做这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.55,0:04:38.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这老糊涂
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.18,0:04:40.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爷爷
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.99,0:04:45.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爷爷
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.63,0:04:47.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗唆的小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.37,0:04:55.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老爷爷
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.57,0:04:56.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刀…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.64,0:05:01.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把这个…拿给那位
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.88,0:05:05.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.64,0:05:06.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.81,0:05:08.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪里？他在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.08,0:05:14.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这女人好像蛮可口的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.09,0:05:16.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把她抓过来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.39,0:05:17.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.82,0:05:19.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们这些家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.33,0:05:22.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我乖乖听话
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.40,0:05:24.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吧 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.40,0:05:28.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕 结界已经…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.54,0:05:40.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们想做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.48,0:05:44.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是头目的命令 快点过来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.62,0:05:45.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.55,0:05:47.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我绝不让你们碰戈薇一根汗毛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.49,0:05:51.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.69,0:05:52.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们逃不掉的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.69,0:05:54.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 数量太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.49,0:05:55.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了她们
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.43,0:06:01.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结界…已经不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.77,0:06:03.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.14,0:06:06.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧 撑着点啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.21,0:06:18.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉…这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.89,0:06:27.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.80,0:06:34.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.10,0:06:36.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟然打破了我的毒茧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.06,0:06:58.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.27,0:07:15.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉的脸…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.64,0:07:16.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖化了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.45,0:07:24.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小鬼 别笑死人了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.36,0:07:33.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,区区半妖也想打赢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.29,0:07:37.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我妖怪 蛾天丸大爷吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.17,0:07:41.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接招吧 小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.32,0:08:05.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么是妖怪之血的气味
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.40,0:08:14.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,融化了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.77,0:08:16.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底不过是个半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.33,0:08:17.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚才说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.77,0:08:22.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这只虫子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.62,0:08:40.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别想逃
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.00,0:08:44.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.60,0:08:50.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.87,0:08:53.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.61,0:08:55.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您又出去了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.61,0:09:00.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷 您在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.58,0:09:01.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.25,0:09:05.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么要把臣丢下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.25,0:09:06.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.65,0:09:10.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是因为和小铃 在一起的关系？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.02,0:09:12.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.26,0:09:16.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种人类女孩 随便哪里一丢就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.26,0:09:20.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道说杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.27,0:09:24.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的为了确认朴仙翁说的话
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.60,0:09:26.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跑到犬夜叉那里去了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.44,0:09:29.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉是什么人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.77,0:09:31.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问得好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.64,0:09:35.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然说来话长 又不知道该不该说
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.05,0:09:37.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.68,0:09:38.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉呀
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.15,0:09:42.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是杀生丸少爷不同血脉的兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.29,0:09:45.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是妖怪的层级 或是气度
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.79,0:09:47.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都无法相提并论
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.66,0:09:49.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,话说回来 其实
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.30,0:09:52.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,唉呀？怎么…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.47,0:09:58.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等…你要上哪去
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.44,0:10:00.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为好像要说很久
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.57,0:10:04.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧 阿 哞
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.14,0:10:06.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那边有好吃的草喔
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.45,0:10:10.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿 哞？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.15,0:10:12.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,未免太刻薄了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.22,0:10:19.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别想跑
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.73,0:11:00.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.00,0:11:04.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母 保护这些人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.24,0:11:09.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.65,0:11:18.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.38,0:11:22.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只是听从头目的命令
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.89,0:11:24.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,饶了我们吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.66,0:11:26.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点住手 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.56,0:11:28.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们已经在求饶了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.76,0:11:34.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连戈薇的声音也听不进去了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.74,0:11:42.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在笑？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.68,0:11:45.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在要杀人的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.08,0:11:51.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 快把铁碎牙 交给犬夜叉然后镇住他
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.92,0:11:54.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想看到犬夜叉那样的脸
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.26,0:11:59.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉！快拿铁碎牙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.76,0:12:02.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,变回原来的样子 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.57,0:12:17.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.08,0:12:19.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么会在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.86,0:12:34.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只会战斗的怪物吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.59,0:12:39.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是犬夜叉从你父亲身上
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.23,0:12:41.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,继承的大妖怪之血
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.37,0:12:44.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对半妖的身体而言太强烈了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.34,0:12:46.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且在不断反覆妖化中
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.74,0:12:50.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总有一日犬夜叉 会完全丧失理智
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.38,0:13:01.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尽管来吧 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.62,0:13:05.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖化之后的你到底有多强
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.82,0:13:07.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我倒要试试看
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.38,0:13:26.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.88,0:13:28.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.78,0:13:30.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸的斗鬼神
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.52,0:13:32.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,单单是剑压就能撕裂敌人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.88,0:13:34.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在碰到它之前就会被打倒的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.16,0:13:43.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟然将剑拨开了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.80,0:13:51.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,白费力气
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.88,0:14:08.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经浑身是伤了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.82,0:14:11.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别再打了 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.06,0:14:15.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 你连恐惧也…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.69,0:14:16.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 应该是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.56,0:14:19.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连疼痛都感受不到
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.07,0:14:23.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被妖怪之血吞噬理智了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.20,0:14:26.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连自己是谁都不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.94,0:14:30.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,持续战斗直到身体毁灭
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.08,0:14:34.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我为了确认朴仙翁说的话
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.35,0:14:37.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才特地跟着你而来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.45,0:14:40.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是可怜 我终于明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.36,0:14:48.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在的你不是完全的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.86,0:14:51.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,追根究底 不过是只半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.73,0:14:54.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让你知道自己有几两重
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.47,0:14:59.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 半妖就该像个半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.00,0:15:01.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在地上爬吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.63,0:15:23.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.00,0:15:32.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.78,0:15:40.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.03,0:15:55.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托不要再打了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.66,0:16:01.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,终于动弹不得了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.03,0:16:05.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要过来 笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.29,0:16:06.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,危险
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.99,0:16:08.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇也会遭殃的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.94,0:16:18.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想让他住手的话
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.67,0:16:21.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用铁碎牙解除他的妖化吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.08,0:16:26.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,否则等他醒过来 又要反抗了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.82,0:16:29.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不是打算杀他吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.95,0:16:34.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才你可以一刀
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.56,0:16:36.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将犬夜叉劈成两半
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.36,0:16:39.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你只用剑压击退他
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.46,0:16:41.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么手下留情
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.10,0:16:44.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你应该很恨犬夜叉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.83,0:16:47.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不认为你是 突然动了兄弟之情
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.47,0:16:49.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我迟早会杀了他
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.07,0:16:50.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是现在
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.34,0:16:54.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连自己是谁都不知道的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.21,0:16:55.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有杀的价值
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.39,0:17:08.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他好像是 来阻止犬夜叉失控一样
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.16,0:17:13.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.06,0:17:15.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你醒来了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.44,0:17:29.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷 您回来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.55,0:17:33.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小玲 有没有好好听话
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.92,0:17:37.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玲和阿跟哞很用心的看家
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.15,0:17:41.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是邪见爷爷好像很消沉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.03,0:17:46.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.93,0:17:49.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.73,0:17:52.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您为何要独自跑去找犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.84,0:17:56.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 不
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.67,0:18:00.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常抱歉 恕我多管闲事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.95,0:18:07.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.39,0:18:19.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 你还不能动
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.39,0:18:21.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些是我做的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.73,0:18:26.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不记得了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.54,0:18:29.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的爪子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.11,0:18:34.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沾满了强盗们的血腥味
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.58,0:18:37.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.25,0:18:41.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉是为了救那些人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.72,0:18:45.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了这个原因才动手的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.73,0:18:57.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是个怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.57,0:18:59.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,靠近他会被杀的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.07,0:19:03.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么这样
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.28,0:19:17.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算是怪物又怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.62,0:19:21.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是大哥哥救了爷爷的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.76,0:19:24.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把坏人通通打跑的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.60,0:19:30.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不对…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.13,0:19:33.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是在狩猎人类而已
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.53,0:19:35.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想变成的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.90,0:19:37.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想要的强悍
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.78,0:19:42.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是这个样子的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.18,0:19:48.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉这次妖化之后
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.05,0:19:51.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,似乎连自己是谁都不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.09,0:19:53.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就连戈薇说的话也…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.86,0:19:55.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.29,0:19:59.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使犬夜叉变成完全的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.06,0:20:01.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还是想和他一起
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.70,0:20:02.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.86,0:20:06.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我为了琥珀给大家添了麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.83,0:20:09.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家依然还是 理所当然一般和我在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.47,0:20:11.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我也…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.60,0:20:36.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 血腥味消不掉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.20,0:20:38.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是恶心
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.92,0:20:55.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毛巾
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.12,0:20:56.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.29,0:21:09.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用勉强陪我没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.64,0:21:16.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎样啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.07,0:21:19.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从刚才大家就对我提心吊胆的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.31,0:21:21.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.58,0:21:24.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是没办法 不在意自己做过的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.65,0:21:26.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.15,0:21:33.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你很痛苦吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.69,0:21:42.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉…我能了解的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.43,0:21:45.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.17,0:21:47.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在妖化那段时间的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.53,0:21:49.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我完全不记得了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.44,0:21:52.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之前从没这样过
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.77,0:21:55.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下次再妖化的话
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.61,0:21:58.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的爪子…戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.45,0:22:02.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说不定会连你都撕成碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.73,0:22:29.47,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,何不把真正重要的事物以外{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.84,0:22:41.08,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全部 都舍弃呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.05,0:22:48.46,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现实 往往是如此残酷
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.49,0:22:51.98,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但每当 遇到这种时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.30,0:22:56.60,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只要紧闭双眼
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.00,0:23:03.46,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,便能看见 你的笑容{\fad(0,900)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.54,0:23:11.17,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Ah- 但愿从此以往
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.02,0:23:18.75,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到进入 沉眠的那一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.46,0:23:26.19,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的 那抹笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.90,0:23:34.00,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都绝没有 消逝的瞬间{\fad(0,900)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.59,0:23:50.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉无法抑制 失控的妖怪之血
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.06,0:23:53.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是他不想变成 只知道战斗的怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.83,0:23:55.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在某处应该有解决的办法
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.37,0:23:57.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果打倒龙骨精
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.83,0:23:59.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙就会变轻
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.37,0:24:02.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接受刀刀斋的试炼
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.61,0:24:04.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,踏上旅程的犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.61,0:24:06.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落又再度布下了陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.81,0:24:09.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.35,0:24:12.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,父亲的宿敌龙骨精
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.42,0:24:13.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敬请期待
